 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The unfait to describe",
   "texto": [
    "It serves to say **cómo era** something or **lo que se hacía** in a regular way: **Autrefois, j'habitais à Lyon** (formerly, he lived in Lyon).",
    "Compare with the present: **J'habite à Lyon** (I live in Lyon, now)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How it forms",
   "texto": [
    "Take the **nous** form from the present and remove **-ons**. Then add these endings: **-ais, -ais, -ait, -ions, -iez, -aient**.",
    "Example: **nous parlons** → **parl-** → **je parlais**.",
    "The exception is **être**, which uses the root **ét-**: **j'étais, tu étais, il était**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Two write changes",
   "texto": [
    "In the verbs in **-ger**, the **e** is kept in front of **a**: **nous mangeons** → **je mangeais**. In the verbs in **-cer**, the **c** passes to **ç** in front of **a**: **nous commençons** → **je commençais**. The soft pronunciation is maintained."
   ]
  },
